Page: DeFi Protocols
Cat: 🔗
Function: Integrates with DeFi protocols for Web3 finance
Description: WalletConnect v2 integration for 8 DeFi protocols: Uniswap, Aave, Curve, Lido, Yearn, Maker, Jupiter, Raydium. Supports swap, LP, lending, staking, and vault operations.
API: GET/POST /api/v1/defi/*
Output: Protocol data, balances, positions, APY, transaction status
Tuna: 9
